<item>
            <title>[KYLIN-5708] The time range of logs included in the job diagnostic package is incomplete</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KYLIN-5708</link>
                <project id="12316121" key="KYLIN">Kylin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;task started executing at 13:40, and the start time of schedule.log and kylin.log are both at 13:49, with no previous logs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;2022-09-21T13:54:52,089 INFO &lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;main&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt; diag : Extract kylin log from 2022-09-21T13:49:00 to 2022-09-21T13:52:33 .&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13558150">KYLIN-5708</key>
            <summary>The time range of logs included in the job diagnostic package is incomplete</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
