                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="17786577" author="JIRAUSER303052" created="Thu, 16 Nov 2023 02:31:03 +0000"  >&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;RootCause&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Root Cause&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The reason for the lack of task creation logs is the addition of TraceID to the logs, which makes it impossible for the canonical rules to get the time of the task creation logs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/13064434/13064434_image-2023-11-16-10-27-44-668.png&quot; height=&quot;115&quot; width=&quot;829&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fix Design&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;At the interval of generating task diagnostic package, add a regular rule which can be adapted to traceId.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The generated regular, for example, jobId is d0f45b72-db2f-407b-9d6f-7cfe6f6624e8.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;Before&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Before&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}T&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2})(. &lt;b&gt;JobWorker.*jobid:d0f45b72.&lt;/b&gt;)|&lt;/sup&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}T&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}). *d0f45b72-db2f-407b-9d6f-7cfe6f6624e8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;a name=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;sup&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}T&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}) (. &lt;b&gt;JobWorker.*jobid:d0f45b72.&lt;/b&gt;)|&lt;/sup&gt;(traceId: (&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9a-z&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{8}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9a-z&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9a-z&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9a-z&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9a-z&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{12}) )? (&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{4}&lt;del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}&lt;/del&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}T&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}:&lt;span class=&quot;error&quot;&gt;&amp;#91;0-9&amp;#93;&lt;/span&gt;{2}). *d0f45b72-db2f-407b-9d6f-7cfe6f6624e8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;</comment>
